{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2023-04-18 17:00:00', 'title': 'AES ANNOUNCES NEXT DECARBONIZATION MILESTONE', 'text': 'AGREES TO PPA BUYOUT AT 205 MW WARRIOR RUN PLANT IN MARYLAND ARLINGTON, VA. , APRIL 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE: AES) TODAY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT TO TERMINATE THE POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENT (PPA) FOR ITS 205 MW WARRIOR RUN COAL-FIRED POWER PLANT IN MARYLAND.'}